## Final Validation

Before marking the plan complete, verify:

### Code Quality
- [ ] Code follows project style guide
- [ ] No duplicate code (jscpd passes)
- [ ] All functions documented with JSDoc
- [ ] All magic numbers extracted to constants
- [ ] All error cases handled
- [ ] All TODOs resolved or documented

### Documentation Quality
- [ ] All examples tested and working
- [ ] All commands documented accurately
- [ ] All options documented
- [ ] All edge cases explained
- [ ] All links working
- [ ] Consistent terminology throughout

### Test Quality
- [ ] All functions have tests
- [ ] All edge cases covered
- [ ] All error paths tested
- [ ] Integration tests comprehensive
- [ ] Test names descriptive
- [ ] Test assertions specific

### Deployment Readiness
- [ ] Package.json updated if needed
- [ ] No breaking changes to existing functionality
- [ ] Backward compatible
- [ ] Migration path clear (if needed)
- [ ] Release notes drafted

